              findings into the ledger</div
            >
          </div>
          <div class="gallery-item">
            <img src="/images/keystrok/rotation.png" alt="Guided rotation" />
            <div class="gallery-caption"
              >Guided rotation: run each step yourself; the revoke step is
              admin-gated and irreversible</div
