            >
            <ul class="impact-list">
              <li
                ><strong>MIT-licensed</strong>, mirrored on Codeberg. No
                paywall, no open-core split.</li
              >
              <li
                ><strong>One command to self-host</strong> (app + Postgres + a local
                mail catcher). Nothing phones home.</li
              >
              <li
                ><strong>Secrets encrypted at rest</strong> (AES-256-GCM); outbound
                calls are SSRF-guarded.</li
              >
              <li
                ><strong>Next.js 15 + TypeScript + Postgres</strong>, shipped as
                a multi-arch image (amd64 + arm64).</li
